## CHAPTER 7 — OUTPUTS

### 7.1 Purpose

This chapter fixes the exact output contract produced by the RTL Standardization & Normalization subsystem, consumed by Phase 14.5.

### 7.2 Outputs

- A standardized RTL source tree, organized per Chapter 11, containing only derived artifacts (never the original source).
