### 7.3 Industrial Notes

The explicit separation between "Standardization Report" (human/reviewer-facing narrative) and "Transformation Provenance" (machine-consumable audit record) mirrors standard industrial practice of maintaining both a qualification report and a machine-readable traveler record for any manufactured or hardened artifact.

