## CHAPTER 11 — DIRECTORY ORGANIZATION

### 11.1 Purpose

This chapter specifies the directory structure of standardization outputs, designed for auditability and for direct, unambiguous consumption by Phase 14.5.

### 11.2 Structure

```
standardized_rtl/
├── <benchmark_id>/
│   └── <version_tag>/
│       ├── <standardization_version>/
│       │   ├── rtl/
