### 11.3 Engineering Rationale

The `<benchmark_id>/<version_tag>/<standardization_version>/` nesting directly extends the versioning pattern already established across Phases 14.2–14.3, ensuring that a standardized RTL artifact is always traceable to an exact acquisition version and an exact standardization policy version simultaneously — a five-axis traceability chain when combined with the annotation and dataset versioning axes of Phase 14.3.

### 11.4 Industrial Notes

Segregating `quarantine/` as a sibling of `rtl/`, rather than omitting quarantined files from the output tree entirely, ensures that reviewers and downstream auditors can inspect exactly what was excluded and why, without needing to cross-reference a separate system.

