### 45.2 Discussion

The subsystem's core architectural pattern — golden-source immutability (Ch. 4.4, 13.5), staged discovery-before-transformation (Ch. 5.4), qualification-revision versioning (Ch. 32.4), and traveler-style metadata (Ch. 29.4) — collectively mirror the methodology infrastructure maintained by commercial semiconductor design-enablement teams for IP qualification and technology-portable RTL hardening. This alignment is a deliberate design choice, not incidental: a dataset-generation pipeline intended to support DTCO research (per this project's overall research title) gains external validity precisely to the degree that its data-engineering methodology reflects practices already trusted within the industry it aims to model and improve upon.

